<title>USA: TJX Cos oks $250 mln stock repurchase.</title>
<headline>TJX Cos oks $250 mln stock repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>FRAMINGHAM, Mass. 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>TJX Cos Inc said Wednesday its board authorized the repurchase of up the $250 million of its stock.</p>
<p>The company said the repurchase, at current prices, represents six percent of its outstanding common shares.</p>
<p>The company said the program provides for the buyback of its common and series E preferred stock and will be accomplished through open market purchased and through other transactions.</p>
</text>
